# Drop the named graphs replaced by the core domain ontology rebuild (2026-10-19).
# The new graphs are https://www.insperity.com/ontology/core/ and https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core/.
# Run in GraphDB › SPARQL (as an update) on the repository, before or after loading the new files.
DROP SILENT GRAPH <https://www.insperity.com/ontology/core-domain/> ;
DROP SILENT GRAPH <https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core-compliance/> ;
DROP SILENT GRAPH <https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core-domain/> ;
DROP SILENT GRAPH <https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core-party/> ;
DROP SILENT GRAPH <https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core-process/> ;
DROP SILENT GRAPH <https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core-product/>
